# CSharpier (`.cs`)

**Authority:** `format-before-handoff-and-commit.mdc` — run CSharpier on changed `.cs` before **handoff** and before **commit**.

**Team formatter:** [CSharpier](https://csharpier.com) — extension for edits; CLI via `.config/dotnet-tools.json`. Style from `.editorconfig`. Skill: **csharpier-format**.

After commit with `.cs` changes, continue with `post-commit-csharp-code-review.mdc`.
